senses.gloss:
जर + .{@-रः@}
—1 Wearing out, wasting.
—2 Destruction.

जरठ + .{@-ठः@}
—1 N. of Paṇdu, father of the five Pāṇḍavas.
—2 Old age.

जरण + .{@-णा@}
—1 Old age.
—2 Praise.

जरण + .{@-णम्@}
—1 Old age.
—2 One of the ten ways in which an eclipse is supposed to end.

जर्जर + .{@-रम्@}
—1 The banner of Indra.
—2 Moss.

जर्ण + .{@-र्णः@}
—1 The (waning) moon.
—2 A tree.
